# Superior personal comfort using a brushless motor and a custom controller

# The Problem
Personal fans are weak. They don't move enough air beyond providing a slight comfort, and they aren't useful for any other sort of application. I wanted something stronger.

# The Solution
![Concept diagram](media/superfanconceptdiagram.jpg)
the general idea is just to add more power. I planned to create a fan powered by a brushless motor and ESC from a drone. to provide throttle power I would have a small microcontroller providing the PWM on a circuit board

